{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-title='Apache HTTPD'>\r\n\t\t\tApache HTTPD\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"https: Place, ssl_module, Logs location, SSLSessionCache: 'shmcb', and <VirtualHost <_default_|domain_name>:443>.","label":"https","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/htaccess","label":".htAccess","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/htaccess"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/info","label":"Info","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/info"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttp:\/\/rubayathasan.com\/tutorial\/apache-ssl-on-windows\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Place<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\"server.cert\" and \"server.key\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAt.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\"C:\\Programs\\Apache\\httpd\\conf\\\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConf\/httpd.conf.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLoadModule.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>ssl_module<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSocache_shmcb_module.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInclude conf\/extra\/httpd-ssl.conf.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConf\/extra\/httpd-ssl.conf.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;VirtualHost &lt;_default_|domain_name&gt;:443&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDocumentRoot.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Logs location<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRelative (\u2018logs\u2019 and not \u2018\/\u2019).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tErrorLog \"logs\/error_ssl.log\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTransferLog \"logs\/access_ssl.log\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSSLEngine on.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>SSLCertificateFile \"${SRVROOT}\/conf\/server.crt\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>SSLCertificateKeyFile \"${SRVROOT}\/conf\/server.key\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tComment out.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>SSLSessionCache: 'shmcb'<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf not including \u2018socache_shmcb_module\u2019.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEnsure full url is as needed in browser when testing.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/https\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/https\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/htaccess' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/htaccess' data-title='.htAccess' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>.htAccess<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/info' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/info' data-title='Info' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image